    "content": "\rD3_covariate_complex_IMPUTED_TD\rD3_EXP_ACT_COVstudy population with all covariates, before imputation\nD3_EXP_ACT_COV_IMPUTATIONstudy population with all covariates, after imputation\nD3_OUTCOMESOutcomes observed in the study population after t0 (\u003e t0), including setting that prompted the observation\nD5_DIAGNOSTIC_MEANING_OUTCOMES\rD5_DIAGNOSTIC_MEANING_OUTCOMES_masked\r ",
