    "content": "\rD5_Table_1Distribution and overlap of propensity scores by treatment group. A separate graph will be generated for the Finnish and UK database instances. D5_Table_2_baseline_cohortTable 2. Patient Characteristics\nD5_Supplementary_Figure_1Distribution and overlap of propensity scores by treatment group.\nD5_Table_3_asd_before_after_trimming\rD5_Table_4_follow_up_time_and_reasons_for_censoringTable 4. Follow-up time, intercurrent events, and reasons for censoring overall and by treatment group\nD5_table_S3\rD5_ResultsIR_HRResults of estimands and sensitivity analyses that use Incidence Rate and Cox model\nD5_ResultsRMSTnumber of persons and outcomes, person-years and incidence rates for E1, E2 and E3; crude and IPTW-adjusted restricted mean survival time (RMST) and its difference for E3 at 3 and 5 years\nD5_ResultsIPCComparison of hazard ratios and 95% Cis from main analysis and sensitivity analyses accounting for nonrandom censoring by IPC-weighting\nD5_Supplementary_Figure_2_MICEdistribution of the propensity score by treatment group in each of the 10 HbA1c-imputed datasets, in bins of width 0.05, with percentiles and mean\nD5_ResultsIR_HR_MICEResults of estimands and sensitivity analyses that use Incidence Rate and Cox model\n ",
