    "content": "\rD5_Table_1_maskedD5_Table_1 (attrition table) with counts between 1 and 4 masked; the same step also exports excluded_counts_masked, used for Figure 1\nD5_Table_2_baseline_cohort_maskedD5_Table_2_baseline_cohort with counts between 1 and 4 masked; all variables are stored as character\nD5_Supplementary_Figure_1_maskeddistribution of the propensity score by treatment group, in bins of width 0.05, with frequencies between 1 and 4 masked\nD5_Table_3_asd_before_after_trimming_maskedD5_Table_3_asd_before_after_trimming with the unweighted counts (before weighting) between 1 and 4 masked; all variables are stored as character\nD5_Table_4_follow_up_time_and_reasons_for_censoring_maskedD5_Table_4_follow_up_time_and_reasons_for_censoring with counts between 1 and 4 masked, and complementary counts of the other exposure group masked as 'NR'; all variables are stored as character\nD5_Table_5_crude_IR_RMST_maskedTable 5. Crude incidence rates (per estimand) and restricted mean survival time for outcome by treatment group\nD5_Supplementary_Figure_2_MICE_maskedD5_Supplementary_Figure_2_MICE with frequencies between 1 and 4 masked\n ",
